# RUN:   %t.yes-bytecode-lto

# This is a structural pay-for-play regression.  It inspects the built native
# runtime archive, native/wasm build graphs, and actual native linked binaries.
# Cross builds feed their final wasm binaries and wasm-ld maps to
# check-dynamic-scan-wasm-link.py; the native build cannot create an
# Emscripten-linked executable without an external wasm sysroot.
